  "description": "Junwoo is one of Korea's most famous celebrities. So who is this person who has dared to pull his pants down?! A meeting gone wrong between a hot-blooded police by the name of \"Soohyun Kang\" and the prideful and arrogant top star \"Junwoo Ha.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/contents?idx=2335), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/47305637), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/v2/Detail?id=505003171), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/susanghan), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=1658811), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/manager_st)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lalatoon.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/7093), S.Chinese ([AC.QQ](https://ac.qq.com/Comic/ComicInfo/id/652608), [KuaiKan](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/15846))",
